  "keyFeatures": [
    "USSD produce listing for farmers on feature phones via Africa's Talking",
    "Funded demand campaigns — buyers specify crop, grade, quantity, and province upfront",
    "Automated produce pooling that aggregates farmer listings against buyer campaigns",
    "Cooperative field agent verification of produce quality and hub location",
    "Flutterwave-powered payment processing with automated payout disbursement",
    "SMS notifications for listing confirmations, campaign updates, and drop-off reminders",
    "Market price reference data by crop type and province",
    "Role-based access control with MFA for admins and buyers",
    "Mobile app for buyers (campaign management) and agents (field operations)",
    "Admin PWA dashboard for platform oversight"
  ],
